uncomfortable with...  OK, I feel a lot uncomfortable with it.  I can't
and won't defend it.  I can only point out that all universities do have
established procedures for dealing with academic misconduct.  Computers
aren't exempt from these procedures.  Temporary account suspension is,
as these things go, a rather minor inconvenience especially since a
successful appeal would certainly include provisions for make-up work or
other paliative measures.

