site, with just over 2000 users; one of our campus' BITNET hosts handles 
something like 20,000 messages/files per day.  Toss in the mail traffic on
our Novell LANs, and you start to see some whopping percentages.

Of course, this particular statistic is going to vary from site to site;
some sites may be ftp-heavy, while others may spew gigabytes of gopher
or nntp traffic.  In any case, we cannot make such claims without know-
ledge of the particular site's situation.

