wouldn't serve any useful purpose consistent with the reason you have
the account.  Lots of students that manage to get their assignments
done without difficulty (disk-wise, I mean) in the space they're
allocated.  I don't see why your tuition should also pay for disk
space for ftp'ing games and GIFs, no matter how cheap disk space is.

